  "notes": [
    "1.0.2 fix: Structures now use galaxyunderchaos:large_single_template instead of minecraft:jigsaw because these templates are single-piece .nbt files, not jigsaw-piece structures.",
    "Planet structure sets were rebalanced so related sites roll from shared planet pools where possible, reducing back-to-back temple/shrine clustering while keeping loot locations available.",
    "Ashla crystal cave is lowered with a negative y_offset so it embeds near the terrain instead of appearing high above the ground.",
    "korriban_massive_sith_temple.nbt is a loot-patched copy of malachor_temple.nbt so Korriban massive temple chests use chests/korriban/massive_sith_temple.",
    "mustafar_ancient_temple.nbt is a loot-patched copy of ancient_temple.nbt so Mustafar ancient temple chests use Mustafar ancient temple loot via the same-length alias ancient_temple_temple.json.",
    "Sith Academy now has the full data-driven structure stack, Korriban biome tags, Sith loot, and Sith structure spawn overrides."
